    "随时可以在“我的”里调整，到期的复习会优先安排。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change this anytime in “Me”. Due reviews always come first."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes cambiarlo cuando quieras en “Perfil”. Los repasos pendientes siempre van primero."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「マイページ」でいつでも変更できます。期限が来た復習が優先されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘마이’에서 언제든 바꿀 수 있어요. 복습할 단어가 먼저 배정돼요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dá para mudar quando quiser em “Perfil”. As revisões pendentes vêm primeiro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时可以在“我的”里调整，到期的复习会优先安排。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隨時可以在「我的」裡調整，到期的複習會優先安排。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
